      47.99,
      467.87,
      542.49,
      529.34
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me under Section 66(G) of the Local Government Institutes Elections Ordinance, Chapter 262, As amended by the Local Government Institutes Election (Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 2012, I, Herath Mudiyanselage Sanjeewanee Herath the Commissioner of Local Government in the North Western Province, hereby notify that the meeting for the purpose of electing the Vice Chairman for the Kobeigane Pradeshiya Sabha, will be convened in terms of the section 66C.(4) of the said Ordinance, held in the council meeting of Kobeigane Pradeshiya Sabha at 10.00 a.m. on 03.02.2026.",
